OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cool, but temperatures will
OL,7,Frise through the night to feel mild by
OL,8,Fdawn. Patchy rain and drizzle will
OL,9,Farrive during the early hours.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FOvercast and murky with patchy
OL,12,Frain, though occasional brighter
OL,13,Fspells are possible. Becoming breezy,
OL,14,Fwith strong gusts in the north later,
OL,15,Fbut feeling very mild with
OL,16,Ftemperatures reaching the high-teens.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
